WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.115
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.385 --> 00:09.025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.425 --> 01:37.225
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎,

4
01:37.305 --> 01:39.025
‎ORIGINAL NOVEL ‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

5
01:42.665 --> 01:43.545
A-Chou.

6
01:45.065 --> 01:46.465
What else do you have to say?

7
01:47.625 --> 01:48.945
I have nothing to say.

8
01:51.945 --> 01:52.905
Guards!

9
01:53.625 --> 01:54.865
-Take her… -Stop!

10
02:09.825 --> 02:10.705
Brother Jue!

11
02:11.465 --> 02:12.745
Grandmother is still sick.

12
02:12.825 --> 02:14.305
How dare you disturb her?

13
02:15.065 --> 02:16.825
Something so serious happened at home.

14
02:16.905 --> 02:19.625
If she isn't here, things might end badly.

15
02:20.385 --> 02:21.465
I had no choice but to put that aside.

16
02:23.105 --> 02:25.225
There's no conclusion to this matter yet.

17
02:25.305 --> 02:27.785
Why are you in a rush to pin the crime on someone?

18
02:29.745 --> 02:32.825
Lady Shou'an. She forged the Longlife Lock.

19
02:32.905 --> 02:35.385
The witness has overturned her testimony, and the bribe is right before us.

20
02:36.065 --> 02:38.865
The crime of deceiving an emperor deserves more than a hundred deaths.

21
02:38.945 --> 02:40.465
Are you going to plead for her?

22
02:40.545 --> 02:45.505
It's difficult to judge an old case, but that doesn't mean it's impossible.

23
02:46.545 --> 02:47.945
She was right.

24
02:48.545 --> 02:50.185
The Longevity Lock was forged,

25
02:50.265 --> 02:54.425
but the clothes, shoes, and socks are real.

26
02:55.305 --> 02:58.745
Besides, even though the wet nurse and the guard are dead,

27
02:58.825 --> 03:01.265
there's still a possibility that they were silenced.

28
03:01.345 --> 03:03.705
As long as there are any doubts, we must investigate it.

29
03:04.225 --> 03:06.665
The truth must come to light.

30
03:08.105 --> 03:10.345
-Mother. -I don't want to talk to you.

31
03:11.905 --> 03:13.425
Look at all of you.

32
03:13.505 --> 03:17.785
Each and every one of you is so keen

33
03:18.505 --> 03:20.305
for her demise.

34
03:20.385 --> 03:22.345
What are you trying to do?

35
03:22.425 --> 03:24.065
Maternal Grandmother!

36
03:24.145 --> 03:25.785
She took my title and my identity!

37
03:25.865 --> 03:27.105
She's backing me into a corner.

38
03:28.185 --> 03:29.945
Mother. Listen.

39
03:30.025 --> 03:31.625
Maternal Grandmother must be too senile

40
03:32.225 --> 03:33.425
for her to say those words.

41
03:37.305 --> 03:38.385
Old Madam Wei,

42
03:39.065 --> 03:42.225
their judgment might be clouded, but you are wise.

43
03:42.865 --> 03:45.665
How could you entertain them in this farce?

44
03:45.745 --> 03:50.585
Are you going to take the word of a fickle wretch

45
03:50.665 --> 03:55.665
and a few strings of worthless coins to simply declare her guilty?

46
03:55.745 --> 04:01.865
She is the only offspring left behind by that dearest son of yours.

47
04:02.865 --> 04:05.665
Aren't you going to investigate this thoroughly first

48
04:05.745 --> 04:08.745
to give Wei Jin's soul some justice?

49
04:11.145 --> 04:12.265
Look.

50
04:12.865 --> 04:15.105
A girl as delicate as a flower.

51
04:15.185 --> 04:16.825
How could you?

52
04:16.905 --> 04:19.305
How could you bear to do it, Old Madam?

53
04:21.265 --> 04:23.105
I can't bear to do it.

54
04:24.625 --> 04:26.265
I can't bring myself to do it.

55
04:27.505 --> 04:29.625
But there's evidence.

56
04:29.705 --> 04:31.465
You call that evidence?

57
04:31.545 --> 04:32.465
He can forge one today,

58
04:32.545 --> 04:34.545
and they can forge something else tomorrow.

59
04:34.625 --> 04:37.825
Evidence is dead, but she is a living person.

60
04:40.185 --> 04:41.385
She mustn't be killed.

61
04:42.025 --> 04:43.105
No one touches her.

62
04:50.505 --> 04:51.465
Guards.

63
04:52.425 --> 04:53.905
Take her away for now.

64
04:54.665 --> 04:57.465
Once I investigate this thoroughly, I will make a decision.

65
04:58.065 --> 04:59.785
-Maternal Grandmother! -Lady Shou'an!

66
05:00.385 --> 05:04.625
She used her title as a noble lady to raise troops and gain support.

67
05:04.705 --> 05:06.265
She has 500 men now.

68
05:06.345 --> 05:08.305
If you don't strike before she grows too powerful,

69
05:08.385 --> 05:10.585
you will never get another chance in the future.

70
05:11.265 --> 05:13.905
An outsider has no right to question my decision.

71
05:16.585 --> 05:17.945
Huo Jue, go.

72
05:18.025 --> 05:18.905
Yes.

73
05:21.865 --> 05:24.345
My Lady, I have no choice but to put you through this.

74
05:25.265 --> 05:26.425
This way.

75
06:10.985 --> 06:12.145
This is serious.

76
06:12.225 --> 06:13.905
Any leaks bring trouble.

77
06:13.985 --> 06:17.425
Everyone, please stay here as guests

78
06:17.505 --> 06:20.145
and allow me to welcome all of you as the host.

79
06:32.705 --> 06:33.745
You betrayed me!

80
06:38.945 --> 06:40.665
I'm only going to ask you one thing.

81
06:42.385 --> 06:44.505
Grandmother only had a cold.

82
06:45.625 --> 06:48.585
Why did you burn such a strong calming incense?

83
06:48.665 --> 06:53.145
The physician told many times that she was to stay in bed to recuperate.

84
06:53.225 --> 06:57.265
The medicine and incense used were all based on the prescription.

85
06:57.345 --> 06:58.545
How is that my fault too?

86
06:58.625 --> 07:01.105
I hope you are telling the truth.

87
07:01.185 --> 07:02.585
-I'm really afraid… -Liar.

88
07:03.185 --> 07:05.505
You kept saying that everything you did was for my sake.

89
07:06.025 --> 07:08.345
You said you would do anything for me.

90
07:08.985 --> 07:10.185
Lies.

91
07:13.225 --> 07:15.105
I'm tired. You may leave.

92
07:15.185 --> 07:17.105
I know about many things,

93
07:18.905 --> 07:20.705
but I pretended to be blind.

94
07:21.305 --> 07:22.585
I pretended to be a fool.

95
07:23.185 --> 07:24.665
I kept covering for you,

96
07:24.745 --> 07:26.745
but I would never allow you to harm Maternal Grandmother.

97
07:27.705 --> 07:29.585
This is against humanity.

98
07:29.665 --> 07:32.745
You're on your own now.

99
07:38.425 --> 07:41.585
Indecisive and sanctimonious.

100
07:43.225 --> 07:44.585
I knew he couldn't be trusted.

101
07:45.425 --> 07:46.665
They are all liars.

102
07:47.185 --> 07:48.025
Rao.

103
07:51.025 --> 07:52.345
Aunt Yufeng, why are you here?

104
07:57.385 --> 07:59.505
Please sit. Let me get someone to serve you sugarcane juice.

105
08:00.665 --> 08:01.865
No need.

106
08:02.625 --> 08:04.465
I'm just a little worried about you.

107
08:04.985 --> 08:08.305
What do you plan to do next?

108
08:09.865 --> 08:11.745
That wretch has been captured.

109
08:11.825 --> 08:13.465
It'll be easy to kill her.

110
08:13.545 --> 08:15.025
What are you even worried about, Aunt Yufeng?

111
08:16.545 --> 08:17.865
Silly child.

112
08:18.465 --> 08:21.065
Although she was captured,

113
08:21.585 --> 08:24.665
once the news reaches the Duke's Residence,

114
08:25.345 --> 08:29.225
Lu Zhuo will never give up easily.

115
08:29.305 --> 08:31.585
He will never do anything with my mother around.

116
08:32.585 --> 08:36.305
Don't think you can rest assured just because you have evidence.

117
08:37.144 --> 08:42.305
Besides eating, a person's mouth can be used to accuse others.

118
08:43.185 --> 08:47.425
It only takes an instant to go against one's words.

119
08:48.585 --> 08:50.025
Don't forget.

120
08:50.105 --> 08:53.665
She's not some housewife you can push around.

121
08:54.945 --> 08:57.345
She is Noble Lady Wu'an,

122
08:58.465 --> 09:00.025
who is loved by the refugees.

123
09:08.545 --> 09:09.585
Just wait and see.

124
09:10.705 --> 09:13.585
If she hasn't returned by dawn,

125
09:14.105 --> 09:18.385
someone will rally the refugees to make a scene.

126
09:19.025 --> 09:20.145
When the time comes,

127
09:20.705 --> 09:23.425
even Lady Li will have no choice but to release her,

128
09:24.905 --> 09:27.105
in spite of her reluctance.

129
09:31.065 --> 09:33.385
She really shouldn't be given the title of a noble.

130
09:33.465 --> 09:34.705
She's such a nuisance.

131
09:36.345 --> 09:38.505
What should we do now, Aunt Yufeng?

132
09:43.625 --> 09:45.705
If you don't deal with the trouble at its roots,

133
09:46.465 --> 09:48.545
it'll only cause further trouble.

134
10:01.065 --> 10:03.945
XIANZHUANG

135
10:04.745 --> 10:06.105
Fu.

136
10:07.385 --> 10:09.625
You've always been bright and have a mind of your own.

137
10:10.225 --> 10:12.265
I've never interfered,

138
10:12.345 --> 10:16.185
but this time, you were too reckless.

139
10:17.305 --> 10:20.665
Mother, there was solid evidence.

140
10:20.745 --> 10:22.705
She was stumped,

141
10:22.785 --> 10:26.065
but you kept defending

142
10:26.785 --> 10:28.825
and protecting her time and again.

143
10:28.905 --> 10:33.385
Are you not afraid of upsetting Rao and hurting your relationship with her?

144
10:33.465 --> 10:35.265
I'm not afraid of anything.

145
10:37.145 --> 10:40.425
I'm just afraid that you, my daughter, will regret doing this.

146
10:43.065 --> 10:45.785
You think A-Chou is the real Wei Rao?

147
10:46.465 --> 10:48.985
I've seen many people in my life.

148
10:49.625 --> 10:51.865
The Wei Rao who grew up in the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence

149
10:51.945 --> 10:54.985
was born with a vicious and cruel personality.

150
10:55.065 --> 10:57.465
She's unlike you or Wei Jin.

151
10:58.425 --> 10:59.705
It's all my fault.

152
11:01.265 --> 11:05.705
She only turned this way without a mother to guide and counsel her.

153
11:06.705 --> 11:11.185
I've lived in the palace for many years and have been away from my daughter.

154
11:12.265 --> 11:15.305
But her grandmother and uncle are at Wei Residence.

155
11:15.385 --> 11:17.345
She also has servants to serve her.

156
11:17.425 --> 11:19.425
There's no way they didn't recognize her.

157
11:19.505 --> 11:21.025
You said she was unlike me.

158
11:22.105 --> 11:24.665
Does A-Chou feel like my biological daughter instead?

159
11:25.465 --> 11:29.025
She's like you and unlike you at the same time.

160
11:30.185 --> 11:32.865
Mother, hearing you say that confuses me even more.

161
11:32.945 --> 11:36.145
She is decisive and confident.

162
11:37.385 --> 11:40.145
Her ambitions and shrewdness are qualities that resemble yours.

163
11:41.265 --> 11:46.185
But she is smarter, more benevolent, and cares more about others than you do.

164
11:46.265 --> 11:49.625
These qualities are like her father, Wei Jin.

165
11:53.385 --> 11:54.425
Mother.

166
11:55.105 --> 11:56.345
Are you that sure?

167
11:57.385 --> 12:00.865
Meet that child alone.

168
12:00.945 --> 12:03.785
Have a good chat with just the two of you.

169
12:05.385 --> 12:06.225
Mother.

170
12:07.705 --> 12:08.705
Let me…

171
12:10.385 --> 12:11.985
Let me think this through.

172
12:12.065 --> 12:14.305
Why are you even hesitating?

173
12:14.385 --> 12:17.105
Why do you keep avoiding this and walk around in circles?

174
12:17.705 --> 12:20.585
Being afraid of a child is unlike you, is it not?

175
12:20.665 --> 12:22.545
This isn't like you at all.

176
12:47.145 --> 12:48.465
-Who is it? -My Lord!

177
12:51.865 --> 12:53.505
My Lord, something has happened to Noble Lady Wu'an.

178
12:53.585 --> 12:56.065
Lady Li abducted her while you were escorting His Majesty.

179
12:56.945 --> 12:58.585
Didn't you submit the evidence?

180
12:58.665 --> 13:00.385
We told them everything, but no one believed us.

181
13:00.985 --> 13:02.465
She said the Longlife Lock was fake.

182
13:02.545 --> 13:05.705
That animal, Lv Lun, went against his word and betrayed Noble Lady Wu'an.

183
13:05.785 --> 13:08.345
Lady Shou'an tried to stop them, but I'm afraid it will be futile.

184
13:08.425 --> 13:10.345
Tomorrow at dawn, they will execute Noble Lady Wu'an.

185
13:13.105 --> 13:14.185
-Zhao Bai. -Yes.

186
13:14.265 --> 13:16.225
Gather the men and head to Xianzhuang. Zhao Song.

187
13:16.305 --> 13:17.705
-Lead the army back to camp. -Yes.

188
13:25.025 --> 13:27.705
Wei Rao, wait for me. I will be there.

189
14:03.265 --> 14:05.145
It's heavily guarded here.

190
14:05.225 --> 14:06.065
How did you come in?

191
14:06.145 --> 14:08.145
I am Lady Li's dearest daughter.

192
14:08.745 --> 14:10.305
Do you think the imperial army can stop me?

193
14:24.065 --> 14:26.345
Her indenture contract was burnt…

194
14:28.545 --> 14:30.985
but I still have her parents and siblings.

195
14:31.705 --> 14:33.905
They are her close ones after all.

196
14:33.985 --> 14:39.465
I'm sure she can't disregard their lives and swear loyalty to you.

197
14:41.665 --> 14:43.665
It's only natural.

198
14:44.745 --> 14:46.305
You need to forgive her.

199
14:48.145 --> 14:49.265
Am I right, Bitao?

200
14:53.945 --> 14:56.145
Oh, I've been talking away.

201
14:56.865 --> 14:59.185
You must be hungry. Let's eat first.

202
15:10.425 --> 15:13.105
What? Are you afraid that I might poison you?

203
15:43.305 --> 15:44.945
You're not the only victim here.

204
15:46.305 --> 15:47.185
Yes.

205
15:48.825 --> 15:50.665
I did grow up in a rich background.

206
15:52.225 --> 15:53.865
But Grandmother is old.

207
15:53.945 --> 15:54.985
She can't take good care of me.

208
15:56.065 --> 15:58.425
The servants fawned on the powerful and looked down on the weak.

209
15:58.505 --> 16:00.425
They bullied me for having no parents to rely on.

210
16:00.945 --> 16:04.305
They kept finding ways to take things away from me

211
16:06.025 --> 16:08.145
to line their pockets.

212
16:15.145 --> 16:16.425
I'm just going to share this with you.

213
16:16.505 --> 16:21.505
Someone called Governess Luo gave me less food when I was sick.

214
16:21.585 --> 16:25.065
She told Grandmother that I needed to fast for the sake of recovery.

215
16:26.025 --> 16:27.585
When I recovered,

216
16:28.145 --> 16:31.025
I lured her to the pond in the garden.

217
16:34.385 --> 16:35.905
Then, I pushed her into the pond.

218
16:39.585 --> 16:41.105
Why are you telling me all this?

219
16:44.225 --> 16:46.105
I know you hate Mother.

220
16:46.185 --> 16:47.545
I hate her too.

221
16:49.905 --> 16:52.145
She left me alone in the residence.

222
16:53.625 --> 16:55.825
I was very lonely and afraid.

223
16:55.905 --> 16:58.705
Everyone sided with Third Sister and bullied me.

224
16:59.465 --> 17:00.305
I won't take that silently.

225
17:01.065 --> 17:04.785
All of those who bullied me and took things from me must pay.

226
17:06.025 --> 17:09.625
I've never said this to others.

227
17:10.464 --> 17:12.265
Because they won't understand.

228
17:17.105 --> 17:18.065
But you do.

229
17:18.865 --> 17:20.065
You understand.

230
17:20.585 --> 17:21.865
After all,

231
17:23.545 --> 17:25.265
you have it rougher than I do.

232
17:26.585 --> 17:28.945
You are alone with no one to rely on.

233
17:29.025 --> 17:30.745
No one has ever loved you.

234
17:31.345 --> 17:34.025
The result has been decided, and our identities are confirmed.

235
17:34.825 --> 17:36.865
I don't really need to kill you.

236
17:37.465 --> 17:41.105
As long as you promise me to leave the capital and never return,

237
17:42.305 --> 17:46.185
I can beg Mother to spare your life.

238
17:48.985 --> 17:50.185
Bitao.

239
18:16.905 --> 18:19.305
This is the Double Cavity Pot.

240
18:19.385 --> 18:20.305
XIANZHUANG

241
18:20.385 --> 18:25.785
There's a hidden mechanism inside that can help Rao get her wish.

242
18:29.065 --> 18:31.025
You know what to do.

243
18:40.945 --> 18:41.985
You fool!

244
18:43.665 --> 18:44.825
You can't even do such a simple thing?

245
18:51.585 --> 18:52.585
You are not doing anything wrong.

246
18:54.545 --> 18:55.905
Everyone has to look out for themselves.

247
19:09.705 --> 19:13.425
You are not the one who decides my fate.

248
19:16.585 --> 19:17.665
Don't feel guilty.

249
19:31.745 --> 19:32.785
You mean it?

250
19:34.065 --> 19:36.185
As long as you promise me, I won't trouble you.

251
19:43.745 --> 19:45.225
Let this cup of wine be our pledge.

252
19:46.705 --> 19:47.825
It's a promise.

253
20:19.305 --> 20:21.505
I've never seen someone as stupid as you.

254
20:22.825 --> 20:25.985
A few words from me, and you trusted me completely.

255
20:27.025 --> 20:28.105
Did you know what you drank?

256
20:28.665 --> 20:30.465
It's poisonous wine!

257
20:33.825 --> 20:35.585
You fool!

258
20:52.945 --> 20:55.185
XIANZHUANG

259
21:03.705 --> 21:05.225
We have imperial orders to seal off the manor.

260
21:05.305 --> 21:06.785
No one can enter this place without being summoned.

261
21:06.865 --> 21:08.585
My Lord, please don't cause us trouble.

262
21:09.465 --> 21:11.065
What if I insist on doing that?

263
21:25.785 --> 21:26.625
Rao!

264
21:27.985 --> 21:29.385
Rao!

265
21:29.465 --> 21:31.065
Rao, wake up!

266
21:31.145 --> 21:32.745
Don't scare me, Rao! Rao!

267
21:34.185 --> 21:36.505
How did you… Rao!

268
21:36.585 --> 21:39.025
Don't scare me. Rao!

269
21:43.185 --> 21:44.185
Rao…

270
21:47.465 --> 21:50.465
You murderer! Return Rao to me!

271
21:50.545 --> 21:52.465
Return Rao to me!

272
21:52.545 --> 21:55.065
No. Lady Wei Rao wanted to poison Noble Lady Wu'an,

273
21:55.665 --> 21:57.065
but something went wrong.

274
21:57.145 --> 21:58.905
She ended up drinking the poisoned wine instead.

275
21:58.985 --> 22:00.305
Noble Lady Wu'an has nothing to do with this.

276
22:00.385 --> 22:02.665
Lady Wei Rao was the one who brought the poisoned wine.

277
22:02.745 --> 22:04.345
You can just test the wine.

278
22:04.425 --> 22:06.625
You traitorous servant!

279
22:06.705 --> 22:08.225
You'll die a cruel death!

280
22:12.665 --> 22:13.865
Lady Li!

281
22:13.945 --> 22:15.345
Lady Li!

282
22:15.425 --> 22:16.425
Lady Li!

283
22:18.065 --> 22:19.745
I am Rao's aunt.

284
22:20.425 --> 22:24.385
Seeing Rao die such a tragic death devastates me,

285
22:24.465 --> 22:27.585
let alone you, her biological mother.

286
22:27.665 --> 22:28.705
Lady Li.

287
22:28.785 --> 22:30.305
You must avenge her.

288
22:30.385 --> 22:32.865
Kill this woman. Kill her!

289
22:57.825 --> 22:59.145
Did you do this?

290
23:00.865 --> 23:03.185
Yes. It was her!

291
23:03.265 --> 23:04.425
She did it, Lady Li!

292
23:05.185 --> 23:06.905
Why are you hesitating?

293
23:06.985 --> 23:09.065
Kill her right now!

294
23:09.145 --> 23:10.665
I did it.

295
23:12.105 --> 23:13.305
She tried to kill me with poisoned wine.

296
23:14.265 --> 23:16.905
I only returned the favor.

297
23:17.825 --> 23:18.825
I did it.

298
23:19.825 --> 23:20.785
You…

299
23:21.385 --> 23:22.425
You…

300
23:24.225 --> 23:26.225
Noble Lady Wu'an, this has nothing to do with you.

301
23:26.305 --> 23:27.825
How could you admit it?

302
23:30.505 --> 23:32.385
I've suffered injustices for 16 years.

303
23:33.825 --> 23:37.825
I walked a long, long way alone.

304
23:39.785 --> 23:42.025
I've suffered so much.

305
23:43.505 --> 23:45.665
I thought I finally found my mother,

306
23:46.305 --> 23:48.865
and everything would start to go well for me.

307
23:48.945 --> 23:51.025
No one would ever bully me again.

308
23:52.425 --> 23:54.345
But my mother tried to kill me.

309
23:58.185 --> 23:59.545
Aren't you going to kill me?

310
24:01.065 --> 24:02.585
Do it now!

311
24:11.745 --> 24:13.185
Do it, Lady Li.

312
24:14.105 --> 24:16.025
I beg you to kill her.

313
24:16.705 --> 24:18.465
Do it, Lady Li!

314
24:20.385 --> 24:22.745
Hurry, Lady Li!

315
24:25.265 --> 24:26.905
Let me do it! I'll kill you!

316
24:26.985 --> 24:28.505
-I'll kill you! -Stop her!

317
24:51.985 --> 24:53.585
What are all of you doing?

318
24:54.625 --> 24:56.905
Don't you have a heart?

319
24:57.825 --> 24:59.785
Why didn't you kill her?

320
24:59.865 --> 25:02.225
Why didn't you kill her?

321
25:04.105 --> 25:06.825
Kill her!

322
25:08.225 --> 25:09.305
Rao!

323
25:09.385 --> 25:10.545
Rao!

324
25:10.625 --> 25:12.505
Rao!

325
25:13.985 --> 25:14.825
Rao!

326
25:14.905 --> 25:16.065
This is…

327
25:16.985 --> 25:19.425
How did this happen?

328
25:19.505 --> 25:22.825
How did things come to this tragedy where no one stands to win?

329
25:24.345 --> 25:26.625
All of you are muddled! Muddled!

330
25:27.425 --> 25:28.305
Lady Li!

331
25:29.145 --> 25:31.745
Are you going to

332
25:32.545 --> 25:36.945
see Rao die such a tragic death without avenging her?

333
25:37.785 --> 25:40.665
Are you not going to kill this woman?

334
25:46.345 --> 25:47.585
What's going on?

335
25:48.905 --> 25:51.945
Lu Zhuo, what are you trying to do?

336
25:54.265 --> 25:55.105
This isn't the place to talk.

337
25:56.105 --> 25:57.625
We'll speak in the hall.

338
26:02.985 --> 26:04.065
Bring him here.

339
26:04.145 --> 26:09.225
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

340
26:14.945 --> 26:16.025
Do you recognize him?

341
26:16.865 --> 26:17.905
The bandits' vice leader

342
26:17.985 --> 26:19.625
who ruled South Mountain for 20 years.

343
26:19.705 --> 26:21.705
A ruthless killer who stops at nothing.

344
26:22.665 --> 26:23.825
They rob traveling merchants,

345
26:24.625 --> 26:26.545
yet the imperial court fails to catch them.

346
26:26.625 --> 26:29.385
Their bounties have been posted at the castle gates all year round.

347
26:30.065 --> 26:32.825
That head just now belonged to the leader, Fushan.

348
26:33.425 --> 26:34.545
As for this…

349
26:35.385 --> 26:36.425
Tuhu.

350
26:37.185 --> 26:38.585
16 years ago,

351
26:38.665 --> 26:40.305
you said a man carried gold up the mountain

352
26:41.105 --> 26:42.865
and hired you lot to kill someone.

353
26:44.865 --> 26:46.585
Every favored servant of the Wei family is here.

354
26:46.665 --> 26:47.745
Who was the one…

355
26:50.745 --> 26:51.905
who hired you to kill?

356
27:10.265 --> 27:13.265
Him! I remember the man has a mole near his chin.

357
27:14.025 --> 27:15.185
It's him. I'm sure.

358
27:15.945 --> 27:17.265
He paid us to kill a man and a woman.

359
27:26.145 --> 27:27.105
Speak.

360
27:27.665 --> 27:29.065
What do they look like?

361
27:30.185 --> 27:31.745
Many years have passed.

362
27:31.825 --> 27:32.665
I don't remember.

363
27:34.225 --> 27:36.465
That man was limping.

364
27:36.545 --> 27:37.705
I think he was a cripple.

365
27:38.425 --> 27:40.785
As for the woman, she was soft and delicate.

366
27:41.505 --> 27:42.625
She also spoke with a Yingchuan accent.

367
27:44.105 --> 27:45.385
Yingchuan accent?

368
27:47.505 --> 27:51.305
Liu, Rao's wet nurse back then, was from Yingchuan.

369
27:52.145 --> 27:55.465
The guards lost Rao and were flogged 40 times as punishment.

370
27:55.545 --> 27:58.145
Hence, all of them had difficulty walking.

371
27:59.385 --> 28:00.625
Take him away.

372
28:09.345 --> 28:10.425
Speak.

373
28:20.745 --> 28:24.065
If you are not going to be honest, your head will roll.

374
28:25.145 --> 28:28.025
No matter how rich you are, you won't be alive to enjoy your wealth.

375
28:28.985 --> 28:30.385
It was Lady Heng'e.

376
28:30.465 --> 28:33.385
She forced me to hire them.

377
28:34.025 --> 28:34.985
What nonsense?

378
28:35.585 --> 28:36.745
Don't make things up!

379
28:36.825 --> 28:37.785
I didn't do it!

380
28:38.625 --> 28:39.625
It's not me!

381
28:40.225 --> 28:42.105
I'm sure Lv Lun was bought off.

382
28:42.905 --> 28:46.905
Lu Zhuo's pulling out everything to save this killer.

383
28:46.985 --> 28:47.865
How can it be me?

384
28:48.465 --> 28:51.305
Lady Li. I didn't do it.

385
28:51.385 --> 28:52.745
I didn't do it. Trust me.

386
28:53.745 --> 28:55.145
You didn't?

387
28:55.225 --> 28:57.425
I didn't. I dare not.

388
28:57.505 --> 28:58.785
-I dare not. -You wretch!

389
29:00.265 --> 29:01.345
Heng'e.

390
29:01.425 --> 29:03.065
What did you do?

391
29:04.665 --> 29:08.865
What did your brother do to offend you

392
29:09.465 --> 29:11.985
that you threw away all conscience?

393
29:12.065 --> 29:13.545
Speak!

394
29:16.985 --> 29:17.945
Lv Lun.

395
29:18.985 --> 29:20.705
When Wei Rao was kidnapped back then,

396
29:22.105 --> 29:23.945
was Wei Heng'e really the mastermind?

397
29:24.545 --> 29:26.785
It was Lady Heng'e who bought the wet nurse off

398
29:26.865 --> 29:28.465
and stole the child.

399
29:29.305 --> 29:31.425
My wife found out about this.

400
29:31.505 --> 29:34.505
She wanted to blackmail her for some money,

401
29:34.585 --> 29:36.745
but Lady Heng'e was more cunning.

402
29:36.825 --> 29:39.825
She found that my wife had once falsified fiscal accounts

403
29:40.425 --> 29:42.105
and used it to blackmail us instead.

404
29:42.705 --> 29:46.105
She forced us to get rid of Lady Rao.

405
29:47.585 --> 29:48.425
How?

406
29:49.345 --> 29:52.105
She wanted us to drown her in quick lime water.

407
30:09.665 --> 30:12.025
You can't bring yourself to do it?

408
30:12.105 --> 30:13.625
I'll do it.

409
30:20.025 --> 30:21.185
Give her to me!

410
30:27.465 --> 30:28.625
How dare you!

411
30:30.665 --> 30:33.025
Both of us were avaricious,

412
30:33.625 --> 30:35.825
but we never intended to harm anyone.

413
30:36.625 --> 30:42.465
Throwing a child into boiling limewater is something even a beast can't do.

414
30:42.545 --> 30:43.625
But if we did not do that,

415
30:43.705 --> 30:45.465
we had no explanation for Lady Heng'e.

416
30:45.545 --> 30:48.145
I had no choice but to be ruthless and left the child

417
30:48.225 --> 30:49.425
on the mountain at night.

418
30:50.025 --> 30:51.065
Next, I went to an orphanage

419
30:51.145 --> 30:53.105
to find the body of a child who died of illness

420
30:53.185 --> 30:55.265
-and report back to Lady Heng'e. -Shut up!

421
30:56.905 --> 30:58.905
So what if you didn't do it yourself?

422
30:59.785 --> 31:02.265
If I hadn't gone to the mountains that night,

423
31:02.345 --> 31:04.465
the child would have been frozen to death.

424
31:06.265 --> 31:08.745
Later,

425
31:09.425 --> 31:12.225
Lady Heng'e brought a girl back

426
31:12.305 --> 31:15.345
and said she was Lady Rao of the Duke's Residence.

427
31:15.425 --> 31:18.785
As for how she found the girl,

428
31:18.865 --> 31:20.705
I really don't know.

429
31:21.385 --> 31:22.505
I really don't.

430
31:28.505 --> 31:29.425
Everyone.

431
31:29.945 --> 31:31.145
Is that so hard to figure out?

432
31:31.225 --> 31:34.185
Wei Rao and Jundai do look very much alike.

433
31:34.825 --> 31:36.345
There can't be such a coincidence in this world.

434
31:37.705 --> 31:40.265
However, Wei Heng'e treated Jundai like her own child

435
31:41.065 --> 31:42.665
and didn't hesitate to kill with a sword for Jundai's sake.

436
31:43.465 --> 31:45.145
Who else, besides Jundai's own mother,

437
31:46.585 --> 31:47.945
would do that?

438
31:53.065 --> 31:54.345
Old Madam Wei.

439
31:54.425 --> 31:57.105
Wei Heng'e is your daughter.

440
31:57.185 --> 32:00.345
You should know Jundai's origin better than anyone else.

441
32:01.585 --> 32:02.705
The child?

442
32:05.665 --> 32:07.425
That illegitimate child?

443
32:10.025 --> 32:12.505
You gave birth to the child?

444
32:13.665 --> 32:17.025
Yes. I gave birth to her.

445
32:18.865 --> 32:22.425
Blame yourself for being biased.

446
32:22.505 --> 32:24.825
Brother fancied Zhou Fu,

447
32:24.905 --> 32:26.465
and you allowed him to turn down his original marriage to marry her.

448
32:26.545 --> 32:30.665
However, I loved Sun and agreed to marry him,

449
32:30.745 --> 32:33.025
yet you said he was just a poor scholar.

450
32:33.105 --> 32:37.465
You forced me to our ancestral home on the outskirts to get an abortion.

451
32:37.985 --> 32:39.065
I would never do that.

452
32:39.625 --> 32:42.945
I did everything I could to keep her alive.

453
32:43.825 --> 32:47.705
Hard as it is, you chose this road.

454
32:48.665 --> 32:50.105
Back then,

455
32:50.185 --> 32:54.385
I did give a chance to that unfaithful man,

456
32:54.465 --> 32:58.945
but he said he would rather take the money than you.

457
33:00.105 --> 33:01.985
You.

458
33:02.065 --> 33:05.745
You disgraceful and immoral wretch.

459
33:05.825 --> 33:08.425
You actually dared to bring this wretched child

460
33:08.505 --> 33:10.545
back into the house.

461
33:10.625 --> 33:14.145
Why shouldn't I do that? Why shouldn't I?

462
33:15.225 --> 33:18.625
When Wei Rao was born, the whole family celebrated.

463
33:18.705 --> 33:19.745
What about my daughter?

464
33:19.825 --> 33:21.785
A wretched child.

465
33:21.865 --> 33:25.145
I hid away in the remote countryside.

466
33:25.225 --> 33:27.505
I didn't even dare call a midwife.

467
33:27.585 --> 33:33.305
When Jundai was born, I had to bite off the umbilical cord myself.

468
33:33.985 --> 33:36.025
It was so unfair to my child.

469
33:37.065 --> 33:40.385
Tell me why! How could you be so unfair?

470
33:40.465 --> 33:43.145
I won't accept this! I won't stand for it!

471
33:49.345 --> 33:52.345
So, you took away Wei Rao and even tried to kill her.

472
33:54.025 --> 33:55.345
She is your niece.

473
33:56.425 --> 33:58.025
She is your brother's only child.

474
33:59.065 --> 34:00.545
If you had even the slightest decency,

475
34:01.145 --> 34:02.625
you wouldn't be so cruel.

476
34:04.305 --> 34:05.585
Lord Lu.

477
34:06.545 --> 34:07.825
You were born with a noble status.

478
34:07.905 --> 34:10.105
You're virtuous and upright. Good for you.

479
34:10.784 --> 34:13.344
My Jundai isn't as fortunate as you.

480
34:13.425 --> 34:15.585
She wasn't born as the heiress of the Duke's Residence.

481
34:15.665 --> 34:20.225
A cuckoo lays its eggs

482
34:20.304 --> 34:21.945
in another bird's nest to ensure posterity.

483
34:22.505 --> 34:24.425
If I hadn't done what I did,

484
34:24.505 --> 34:27.585
Jundai would have stayed in the rural area forever

485
34:28.185 --> 34:31.465
and become a lowly illegitimate daughter.

486
34:32.185 --> 34:35.945
Without the status of a noble and protection from her family,

487
34:36.025 --> 34:37.945
there wouldn't be a future for her.

488
34:38.025 --> 34:40.425
For the sake of my own child,

489
34:40.505 --> 34:42.225
I can't care about anything else.

490
34:44.105 --> 34:45.145
Actually…

491
34:45.985 --> 34:50.585
Actually, I never planned to kill Rao initially.

492
34:51.744 --> 34:54.025
If anyone is to be blamed for all this,

493
34:54.625 --> 34:57.425
then it's your fault, Zhou Fu.

494
34:59.185 --> 35:00.225
My fault?

495
35:01.265 --> 35:02.265
At first,

496
35:02.825 --> 35:05.145
I had intended to give Rao away to be raised by others.

497
35:05.785 --> 35:08.505
But you just wouldn't let her go.

498
35:08.585 --> 35:10.345
You ordered the imperial army, searched the city

499
35:10.425 --> 35:12.825
and question everyone to find her.

500
35:12.905 --> 35:14.825
If you hadn't pushed so hard,

501
35:14.905 --> 35:16.385
the wet nurse wouldn't have panicked

502
35:16.465 --> 35:18.585
and pleaded with me to send her back home.

503
35:18.665 --> 35:22.225
I would never have been so ruthless as to hire someone to kill Rao.

504
35:22.305 --> 35:23.625
Wei Heng'e.

505
35:24.425 --> 35:26.665
You are at fault for everything,

506
35:26.745 --> 35:28.465
and you're still trying to blame someone?

507
35:29.065 --> 35:31.025
-You animal! -Oh my.

508
35:31.545 --> 35:33.625
You're an animal!

509
35:34.585 --> 35:36.985
What did I do to have

510
35:37.065 --> 35:42.345
such a selfish and heartless daughter like you?

511
35:43.105 --> 35:46.425
I spared you in the beginning,

512
35:47.025 --> 35:51.425
and that ended up harming my granddaughter in the end.

513
35:56.065 --> 35:57.105
Rao…

514
35:59.185 --> 36:02.065
I've let you down.

515
36:03.465 --> 36:04.705
I'm so ashamed.

516
36:05.385 --> 36:08.465
Too ashamed to face you.

517
36:10.185 --> 36:14.105
Mother. Calm down, Mother.

518
36:14.625 --> 36:15.865
After all, Heng'e was the one

519
36:15.945 --> 36:19.225
who was blinded by her selfish motives and acted recklessly.

520
36:19.945 --> 36:21.065
You're not to be blamed.

521
36:22.065 --> 36:27.465
Her judgment was probably clouded because she loves her daughter too much.

522
36:28.265 --> 36:29.105
Mother.

523
36:29.705 --> 36:32.665
Old Madam Wei, forgive me for being blunt.

524
36:33.705 --> 36:35.305
If you really cared about your granddaughter,

525
36:36.505 --> 36:38.025
she would never be kidnapped.

526
36:38.865 --> 36:40.545
You would never confuse her with the fake Wei Rao.

527
36:41.585 --> 36:43.985
After all, an impostor can never be the real person.

528
36:44.665 --> 36:47.385
Perhaps no one in the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence

529
36:48.105 --> 36:49.465
has truly cared for her.

530
36:50.825 --> 36:52.705
They are completely different.

531
36:52.785 --> 36:54.665
Their personalities are like night and day.

532
36:55.705 --> 36:58.105
I've never gotten her wrong. Not once.

533
36:58.745 --> 37:00.505
You're her own flesh and blood.

534
37:01.465 --> 37:03.265
How could you make such a huge mistake?

535
37:05.545 --> 37:06.705
It's my mistake.

536
37:07.305 --> 37:12.465
I was drowning in the pain of losing my son

537
37:12.545 --> 37:15.225
and neglected Rao.

538
37:18.985 --> 37:20.025
Bitao.

539
37:20.705 --> 37:22.305
The one who asked you to swap the Lifelong Lock,

540
37:24.225 --> 37:26.065
was it really Wei Heng'e?

541
37:27.545 --> 37:29.185
What Lifelong Lock?

542
37:31.225 --> 37:33.305
I've never swapped something called Lifelong Lock.

543
37:35.065 --> 37:36.105
All of you.

544
37:36.705 --> 37:38.665
Don't celebrate too early.

545
37:40.345 --> 37:43.225
Back then, it was snowing.

546
37:43.945 --> 37:47.025
The child was abandoned on the desolate rear hill.

547
37:47.545 --> 37:49.785
Perhaps she was already frozen to death.

548
37:49.865 --> 37:51.625
Perhaps that child didn't survive.

549
37:52.665 --> 37:54.265
Jundai is a fake.

550
37:54.345 --> 37:56.785
This woman might not be the real thing either.

551
37:56.865 --> 37:58.545
She didn't have any evidence.

552
37:58.625 --> 38:00.945
She's just an impostor!

553
38:01.945 --> 38:02.825
My Lord.

554
38:03.345 --> 38:06.505
We must never show mercy to a vicious woman like her.

555
38:07.185 --> 38:08.305
Don't worry.

556
38:08.905 --> 38:10.745
I have my own ways to make her speak the truth.

557
38:13.185 --> 38:14.705
My Lord, if you punish her severely,

558
38:15.665 --> 38:17.305
it would appear that I am abusing my position.

559
38:18.265 --> 38:19.185
You are my wife.

560
38:19.785 --> 38:21.385
I'm willing to let you wield my power and influence.

561
38:22.465 --> 38:23.705
Let's see who dares defy me.

562
38:25.745 --> 38:26.865
And who dares object to me?

563
38:30.385 --> 38:32.425
I do have something to ask Aunt Yufeng.

564
38:35.945 --> 38:37.705
Why did you ask Jundai to poison me?

565
38:39.945 --> 38:43.425
And why did you kill Jundai in the end?

566
38:44.585 --> 38:45.425
What did you say?

567
38:58.185 --> 39:00.145
I tried to kill Jundai with poison?

568
39:01.305 --> 39:03.145
How did this come about?

569
39:03.225 --> 39:04.865
Aunt Heng'e is a daughter married out.

570
39:05.385 --> 39:07.265
She has no absolute power in Wei family.

571
39:07.865 --> 39:09.665
Buying off a wet nurse and a guard was easy,

572
39:09.745 --> 39:11.585
but swap Jundai into the family was rather difficult.

573
39:12.465 --> 39:14.825
Grandmother could not make a sound decision after losing her son.

574
39:15.505 --> 39:17.265
She lay in her bed all day.

575
39:17.345 --> 39:21.145
All of Wei Residence was under your control, Aunt Yufeng.

576
39:21.225 --> 39:23.385
If she brought in an impostor,

577
39:23.465 --> 39:25.905
how could it fool you, the lady of Wei Residence?

578
39:30.865 --> 39:33.345
You had many close servants in your courtyard.

579
39:33.425 --> 39:36.265
Were they all blind and couldn't recognize anyone?

580
39:37.625 --> 39:38.585
Unless…

581
39:39.185 --> 39:42.065
Old Madam Wei, every servant in Wei Rao's chamber was replaced

582
39:42.585 --> 39:43.865
after the incident.

583
39:43.945 --> 39:44.785
Am I right?

584
39:54.105 --> 39:55.065
Lady Li,

585
39:55.665 --> 39:59.145
Back then, His Majesty's love for you made him furious.

586
39:59.225 --> 40:01.305
He blamed our Wei family for failing to look after the child.

587
40:01.905 --> 40:03.785
We nearly lost our noble title.

588
40:03.865 --> 40:06.905
So all the servants were scapegoats.

589
40:06.985 --> 40:11.425
They were either sold to faraway places or banished to the estate.

590
40:12.345 --> 40:13.825
When Jundai returned,

591
40:13.905 --> 40:17.185
those who served her were taught by the Old Madam

592
40:17.265 --> 40:20.225
to prevent any mistakes from happening again.

593
40:20.785 --> 40:22.665
Or, we can't explain to the imperial court.

594
40:23.265 --> 40:25.385
Replacing all the previous servants for no reason.

595
40:25.905 --> 40:27.465
Obviously, you were up to something.

596
40:32.385 --> 40:33.465
Aunt Heng'e.

597
40:33.545 --> 40:36.025
Only Jundai and I were in the room.

598
40:36.105 --> 40:37.865
Why would I do something so foolish to poison her there?

599
40:38.465 --> 40:39.625
Think carefully.

600
40:40.305 --> 40:43.105
Who told Jundai to come to my room with the poisonous wine?

601
40:43.625 --> 40:47.225
Who, once again, would see Jundai and I cut each other down?

602
40:48.105 --> 40:51.825
On the surface, the person is helping you and Jundai out of trouble

603
40:51.905 --> 40:55.385
but really, he's leading you step by step into the deep end.

604
40:56.625 --> 40:57.745
Guo Yufeng.

605
40:59.905 --> 41:01.385
It was you?

606
41:02.385 --> 41:06.065
You were the one who incited Jundai to poison Wei Rao?

607
41:07.065 --> 41:08.865
It was you who killed my daughter.

608
41:13.345 --> 41:14.705
I'm going to kill you!

609
41:14.785 --> 41:16.705
I'm going to kill you, Guo Yufeng!

610
41:16.785 --> 41:19.065
Give me back my daughter! Give her back!

611
41:19.145 --> 41:21.105
Let me go!

612
41:21.185 --> 41:23.985
-Give her back to me! -Lady Guo.

613
41:24.065 --> 41:28.665
What's in it for you if Wei Rao and Jundai destroy each other?

614
41:29.545 --> 41:33.625
What did Jundai do to you that you wanted to kill her?

615
41:34.145 --> 41:36.305
If Wei Rao had been poisoned to death,

616
41:36.905 --> 41:38.425
when the truth is revealed,

617
41:38.945 --> 41:42.105
and Lady Li comes to know the facts, she will be beside herself with grief.

618
41:42.865 --> 41:43.785
If Jundai was killed,

619
41:45.105 --> 41:48.425
Wei Rao would die by her own mother's hands.

620
41:49.625 --> 41:51.145
Lady Li abandoned her own daughter and then took her life.

621
41:52.025 --> 41:53.825
by what right will she ever stand in the world?

622
41:54.745 --> 41:57.585
The moral conduct of an imperial consort is there for everyone to see.

623
41:58.185 --> 42:01.385
The position and power she possesses will all go down the drain.

624
42:02.985 --> 42:06.305
Kill the daughter first, and then get rid of the mother.

625
42:06.905 --> 42:09.185
I've seen many schemes on the battlefield,

626
42:09.265 --> 42:14.065
but I've never seen such a nefarious psychological ploy.

627
42:20.145 --> 42:21.305
Guo Yufeng.

628
42:22.745 --> 42:25.225
It is not Jundai you are after.

629
42:27.345 --> 42:28.905
Not even Wei Rao.

630
42:32.665 --> 42:37.545
What you truly seek is to destroy my very soul, isn't it?

631
42:59.305 --> 43:00.305
How clever of you.

632
43:03.825 --> 43:05.345
Let me ask you then.

633
43:06.825 --> 43:10.825
How did you know that I was trying to poison Jundai

634
43:11.505 --> 43:12.705
instead of you?

635
43:13.505 --> 43:15.025
Because you let Bitao to pour the wine.

636
43:16.185 --> 43:17.545
She has been by my side every day.

637
43:18.145 --> 43:19.145
She might betray me,

638
43:20.465 --> 43:23.905
but she is kind and will never intend to kill me.

639
43:28.225 --> 43:31.505
My Lady, I've let you down.

640
43:32.425 --> 43:34.945
I swapped the Lifelong Lock.

641
43:35.865 --> 43:38.425
I did it when you headed to the Wei Residence.

642
43:43.625 --> 43:46.065
The real Lifelong Lock

643
43:46.145 --> 43:49.545
must be in the hands of Governess Zheng in Lady Guo's chamber.

644
43:52.065 --> 43:52.905
Search her chamber.

645
43:56.105 --> 43:57.505
Guo Yufeng.

646
43:58.345 --> 44:00.785
You deserve to die a cruel death!

647
44:00.865 --> 44:03.945
You've been using me all this while.

648
44:04.785 --> 44:07.545
When I was blackmailing the Changs,

649
44:08.105 --> 44:10.785
she purposely rushed in and foiled my plan.

650
44:11.385 --> 44:13.465
I was forced to kneel and beg her.

651
44:13.545 --> 44:16.785
I had to give up many of my assets

652
44:18.065 --> 44:20.705
so she promised to help me keep secrets.

653
44:21.665 --> 44:25.585
So it was all a setup, all your game.

654
44:25.665 --> 44:31.625
I, the poor Wei Rao, and Jundai were all living inside your trap.

655
44:33.145 --> 44:34.585
You and your daughter.

656
44:35.905 --> 44:40.345
One is selfish and greedy, while the other is arrogant and brazen.

657
44:41.545 --> 44:43.345
Blame yourselves instead.

658
44:47.585 --> 44:50.065
I actually envy you.

659
44:50.785 --> 44:53.825
That daughter you've never raised and educated

660
44:54.945 --> 44:56.745
actually turns out to be so intelligent.

661
44:56.825 --> 45:00.705
She even found you a heroic son-in-law,

662
45:01.305 --> 45:04.305
who will take the greatest risk in the world for her.

663
45:05.625 --> 45:07.865
Go against an imperial decree. Refuse to meet His Majesty.

664
45:09.265 --> 45:13.105
For her, he even wiped out a whole bandit's hideout.

665
45:19.465 --> 45:22.065
If he were late by just a little,

666
45:23.465 --> 45:25.985
just a little bit,

667
45:27.425 --> 45:29.105
given your vicious personality,

668
45:29.185 --> 45:32.065
your daughter would surely die in your hands.

669
45:32.665 --> 45:33.665
What a pity.

670
45:34.425 --> 45:36.865
What a huge pity.

671
45:39.185 --> 45:41.425
I'll rip you apart!

672
45:49.305 --> 45:50.825
Why do you hate her so much?

673
45:52.225 --> 45:56.665
Why don't you ask your mother what she did?

674
45:56.745 --> 45:57.785
Shut up.

675
45:57.865 --> 46:01.025
Your ears mustn't be sullied by the words of a crazy woman.

676
46:01.105 --> 46:02.305
Seal her mouth shut.

677
46:02.385 --> 46:04.225
-Stop her from spouting nonsense. -What?

678
46:04.825 --> 46:05.585
Are you afraid?

679
46:06.185 --> 46:08.065
Afraid I'll expose your daughter

680
46:08.145 --> 46:11.385
in front of everyone and shame her?

681
46:12.345 --> 46:15.665
A woman who abandoned her husband and daughter.

682
46:15.745 --> 46:17.865
Everyone in the world knows what she's like.

683
46:18.825 --> 46:22.305
Wei Rao will see her true colors sooner or later.

684
46:23.825 --> 46:27.345
-Shut up! -She can't hide it from anyone else!

685
46:27.945 --> 46:29.665
What can't I admit?

686
46:30.625 --> 46:32.265
I have never feared the tongues of others.

687
46:32.825 --> 46:33.665
Guo Yufeng.

688
46:34.505 --> 46:37.265
You hate me so much and took revenge against me.

689
46:37.785 --> 46:40.665
Isn't it because of your marriage agreement with Wei Jin?

690
46:41.625 --> 46:43.705
He willingly turned down the agreement to marry me.

691
46:44.305 --> 46:45.905
It's all the man's fault,

692
46:46.425 --> 46:48.825
yet you took out your hatred on me.

693
46:50.985 --> 46:52.265
It's all my fault.

694
46:53.185 --> 46:56.225
I pitied you back then

695
46:56.305 --> 46:58.185
and allowed you to marry into the Wei residence.

696
46:59.585 --> 47:05.545
I thought I could save your life and stop the others from badmouthing you,

697
47:06.345 --> 47:11.385
but I didn't expect you to hold a grudge instead.

698
47:13.785 --> 47:15.505
Save my life?

699
47:16.905 --> 47:19.145
You ruined my whole life!

700
47:20.385 --> 47:23.665
Do you think everyone wanted to marry your banal,

701
47:23.745 --> 47:25.785
perverted eldest son?

702
47:25.865 --> 47:28.585
Taking another glance at him makes me sick!

703
47:30.385 --> 47:33.025
Don't forget. Your family was the one

704
47:33.105 --> 47:35.665
that went back on your promise and voided my marriage agreement.

705
47:35.745 --> 47:38.345
It was your dotage and folly that allowed Zhou Fu into this family.

706
47:38.425 --> 47:40.785
That was the cause of everything that happened today.

707
47:44.385 --> 47:47.625
If you have a grudge, just come at me.

708
47:50.265 --> 47:54.425
-Why would you hurt the innocent children? -Zhou Fu,

709
47:55.425 --> 47:56.505
you are smart,

710
47:58.305 --> 47:59.345
cold,

711
48:00.905 --> 48:02.585
and consumed by the desire for power.

712
48:03.905 --> 48:08.545
You think you're above everyone and invincible.

713
48:09.465 --> 48:13.305
A woman's greatest weakness is her children.

714
48:13.385 --> 48:14.985
You are a mother, after all.

715
48:15.065 --> 48:19.305
If your daughter dies, you will feel pain.

716
48:20.505 --> 48:24.385
If you were a little more careless, she would die by your hands.

717
48:24.905 --> 48:28.625
That kind of pain is a pain that tears at your heart and bones,

718
48:28.705 --> 48:30.625
so unbearable that you would rather be dead.

719
48:30.705 --> 48:33.545
Every other form of revenge pales in comparison.

720
48:34.665 --> 48:36.865
I am above such petty retaliation.

721
48:41.345 --> 48:42.545
Guards!

722
48:43.785 --> 48:45.105
Take her away!

723
49:50.225 --> 49:51.865
Lady Li loves her daughter too much.

724
49:52.865 --> 49:54.025
That's why she was misled.

725
49:55.545 --> 49:56.585
Even then,

726
49:57.505 --> 49:59.545
she never really had it in her to do it.

727
50:01.145 --> 50:05.425
You have always been the daughter she loves dearly.

728
50:07.105 --> 50:07.945
Is that so?

729
50:20.705 --> 50:21.545
Mingzhu.

730
50:22.545 --> 50:23.545
No.

731
50:24.585 --> 50:25.425
Rao.

732
50:27.265 --> 50:28.865
I am your mother.

733
50:28.945 --> 50:29.865
Mother…

734
50:31.545 --> 50:32.585
Mother.

735
50:34.585 --> 50:37.625
Then how could a mother not recognize her own child?

736
50:39.585 --> 50:40.985
If it were possible…

737
50:43.025 --> 50:45.305
I would rather you never gave birth to me.

738
50:50.145 --> 50:51.065
Rao.

739
50:54.025 --> 50:55.145
Rao!

740
50:55.825 --> 50:59.345
GUANYUN HALL

741
50:59.425 --> 51:00.945
Rao!

742
51:02.105 --> 51:03.385
Rao!

743
51:07.785 --> 51:09.105
Rao!

744
51:12.225 --> 51:13.905
Rao!

745
51:18.305 --> 51:19.825
Don't push her too far.

746
51:22.505 --> 51:23.825
Get yourself together!

747
51:24.425 --> 51:25.345
Listen to Lu Zhuo.

748
51:26.705 --> 51:27.625
All right.

749
51:27.705 --> 51:29.985
I won't push her. I won't.

750
51:30.625 --> 51:31.465
Go with her quickly.

751
51:32.145 --> 51:34.265
Bring her back safely. All right?

752
51:40.345 --> 51:43.665
Had you known how it'd end, you wouldn't have done it.

753
52:11.545 --> 52:12.625
Mother!

754
52:12.705 --> 52:13.785
-You useless thing! -Stop it!

755
52:13.865 --> 52:14.825
Get lost!

756
52:16.585 --> 52:17.665
You sickly wretch!

757
52:17.745 --> 52:19.425
Mother!

758
52:53.185 --> 52:54.025
Where are you going?

759
52:56.865 --> 52:57.705
What's scaring you?

760
52:59.505 --> 53:00.505
Afraid I'll end it all?

761
53:03.825 --> 53:04.665
I won't.

762
53:05.465 --> 53:08.665
Even if everyone hates me and abandons me,

763
53:10.025 --> 53:11.225
I won't take my own life.

764
53:12.705 --> 53:14.545
-Come back with me. -No!

765
53:16.025 --> 53:17.105
I'm not going back there.

766
53:17.705 --> 53:19.505
I want to be back to my own place.

767
53:20.225 --> 53:21.905
You don't even know where you are going.

768
53:21.985 --> 53:23.505
You won't arrive anywhere like this.

769
53:24.025 --> 53:26.825
-Let go of me. Let go! -I'll take you there.

770
53:27.545 --> 53:29.505
Let go of me!

771
53:29.585 --> 53:32.025
Let go!

772
53:37.385 --> 53:38.745
Lord Lu!

773
53:41.265 --> 53:43.825
Why are you still so foolish?

774
53:44.585 --> 53:46.225
I've never loved you.

775
53:46.305 --> 53:48.625
Not even a day, an hour, or a minute.

776
53:48.705 --> 53:49.945
I've always been using you!

777
53:53.265 --> 53:55.545
You are just the same as Han Liao and Qi Zhongkai.

778
53:56.265 --> 53:58.225
You are just a stepping stone for me.

779
53:58.905 --> 54:00.185
You knew it exactly

780
54:00.785 --> 54:02.465
yet you still rushed headlong into it.

781
54:03.465 --> 54:04.505
Then you are a fool.

782
54:05.545 --> 54:07.465
If you have even a bit of dignity,

783
54:08.465 --> 54:09.985
you should stop clinging to me.

784
54:33.305 --> 54:34.905
What are you doing?

785
54:36.425 --> 54:37.905
I knew you were a cold woman.

786
54:38.425 --> 54:39.625
You can never drive me away.

787
54:41.065 --> 54:44.105
No matter what you say, I will take you back tonight.

788
54:44.825 --> 54:46.145
-We're going home. -Let go of me!

789
54:47.225 --> 54:48.065
Let go!

790
56:58.745 --> 57:02.145
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
